# Selection publisher (touchscreen)
user tab5
topic readwrite aquadrone/target_sysid
topic readwrite aquadrone/ctrl/tab5/status
topic read aquadrone/ctrl/+/status

# Control box only follows the selection
user ctrlbox
topic read aquadrone/target_sysid
topic readwrite aquadrone/ctrl/ctrlbox/status

# Pi-side GCS selection filter
user filter
topic read aquadrone/target_sysid
topic readwrite aquadrone/ctrl/filter/status

# Dev PC / bench testing with mosquitto_pub/sub
user operator
topic readwrite aquadrone/#
